{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11103010","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11103010","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1110301001:1":{"text":"We're back.","source_cn":"给你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x63B9C316CAA2EBB2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1110301002:1":{"text":"Ah! Soren and Alsa of the Uru Clan! Yes, this is indeed a spider egg unique to the sand spider!","source_cn":"哦！你们是乌尔氏族的索恩和阿尔萨！嗯，验证无误——这确...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA42EE8D2AC058A3D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1110301003:1":{"text":"Everyone, let's congratulate the Uru Clan for passing their first trial! A round of applause for these two young warriors!","source_cn":"曼卡拉的老朋友们，让我们恭喜乌尔氏族通过第一道试炼！给...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x373180963CB10031","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1110301004:1":{"text":"Whoa! Soren, they're cheering for us!","source_cn":"哇！索恩，大家在为我们鼓掌呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F25B0F8E1BD87B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1110301005:1":{"text":"Hello, everyone! The Uru Clan welcomes you if you visit! Tell them you know Alsa!","source_cn":"大家好！欢迎大家来乌尔氏族做客，记得报我阿尔萨的名字哦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF62A03F188AF1680","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1110301006:1":{"text":"The Uru Clan is weak! Go home! You're not welcome at the Warsong Festival!","source_cn":"——乌尔氏族的弱者，快滚回家吧！战歌节不欢迎你们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x844C0454CAFAA5C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1110301007:1":{"text":"What's going on...?","source_cn":"这是……怎么回事？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD5C32ABBFA42384","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1110301008:1":{"text":"Don't you know how crazy your odds are? Because you returned from the trial, some people lost a fortune betting against you!","source_cn":"呵！你们不知道自己赔率多离谱吗？光是能从赤沙蛛域回来，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x60518600A2ADC5C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1110301009:1":{"text":"Those who underestimate us will surely pay the price.","source_cn":"小看我们的人，将我们视为弱者的人——我说过，迟早要让他...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8FB96B0B6D70C65A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:11:1110301009":{"text":"Those who underestimate us will surely pay the price.","source_cn":"小看我们的人，将我们视为弱者的人——我说过，迟早要让他们付出代价。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8FB96B0B6D70C65A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1110301010:1":{"text":"I am calm. One day, the entire desert will know the power of the Uru Clan.","source_cn":"我没生气。总有一天，整片沙漠都会知道，乌尔氏族不可小觑……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB3663E93FCC6BD81","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1110301013:2":{"text":"Stop right there! Tender words have no place here! Mikola and friends prefer the roars of victory and the cries of the defeated!","source_cn":"打住打住！完全不想听这么温情款款的抚慰哦！曼卡拉和老朋...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB3ECBF692F476156","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1110301014:1":{"text":"No matter how strong our enemy is, we will never cry out.","source_cn":"我们不会惨叫的。即使敌人再强也一样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x07598BE206CC5FCA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1110301015:1":{"text":"Is that so? Remember what you just said, young warriors. It's time to get ready for our second test, the <style=\"highlight\">Trial of Souls</style>.","source_cn":"是吗？记住你现在的话，年轻的勇士，迎接我们的第二道试炼...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x515E0FE25C87DB90","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1110301016:1":{"text":"You may wonder what this trial is about, but that's a secret. Someone will come find you when the trial begins.","source_cn":"不过，试炼内容暂时保密，耐心等待即可。试炼开始时，会有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB90824387FF98E75","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1110301017:1":{"text":"So does that mean we can rest and wait back at the Uru Clan until the trial starts?","source_cn":"这是不是说明，我们可以先回乌尔氏族休整，等待试炼开始？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x60A64323A21190BB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1110301018:1":{"text":"Great! Soren, it's time to go home!","source_cn":"太好了！索恩，走，回家啦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x61E1F7DCE2E75E8C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:11:0:1":{"text":"Calm down, Soren.","source_cn":"索恩，别生气","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2FF44D267E62DC2F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Calm down, Soren.","female":"Calm down, Soren.","variant_male_record_index":"63358","variant_female_record_index":"63359","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1110301011:1":{"text":"I'm not! Actually, I really want to go back and check on everyone at home.","source_cn":"其实我没在难过啦！而且，我是真的很想快点滚回家里去看看呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFCAC5402D9237C32","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1110301012:1":{"text":"I'm not sure if Soren and I left enough food for everyone. I hope they're not hungry...","source_cn":"唉，也不知道我和索恩出来这么久，给大家留的食物够不够，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A9D656E7DDD0986","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:11:1:2":{"text":"Alsa, don't be upset.","source_cn":"阿尔萨，别难过","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x46DE780D2E992562","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Alsa, don't be upset.","female":"Alsa, don't be upset.","variant_male_record_index":"63360","variant_female_record_index":"63361","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:索恩":{"text":"Soren","source":"索恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:曼卡拉":{"text":"Mikola","source":"曼卡拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:阿尔萨":{"text":"Alsa","source":"阿尔萨","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:不友善的蛮血":{"text":"Hostile Mauler","source":"不友善的蛮血","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":22,"localized_text_count":21,"speaker_count":4}}